  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Development: Strengthening innovation, Resilience and the Sustainability of Agrifood Systems in North Central Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change

The project&apos;s development objective is to improve the income, food and nutrition security and climate resilience of the families of small-scale rural producers living in poverty and vulnerable rural populations through the development of nutrition-sensitive, climate-resilient agrifood systems. Its goal is to contribute to poverty reduction and equal opportunities for these groups in the North Central region of Honduras.NutritionFinancial Services</narrative>
  </description>
